  "title": "epan: except: Get rid of an old GLib workaround",
  "description": "Get rid of an old GLib workaround for the change in g_malloc's\nsignature that happened back in GLib 2.20.0.[1,2] We've required\na more recent version of GLib since that since version 2.4 of\nWireshark.\n\n[1] - https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib/-/commit/1fcaf2fe8d5118451e5d9da3347f711b623d504d\n[2] - https://github.com/GNOME/glib/commit/1fcaf2fe8d5118451e5d9da3347f711b623d504d\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
